			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>夏：主人公性別が♂
・はい/いいえ
　はい→summer_m_02
　いいえ→summer_m_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:19" />
